// Example of a scoped object macro (Ruby).

+ *
- No reply for that. Type "scope test" to test the scope functionality.

+ scope test
- Testing the scope!\n<call>scopeTest</call>

> object scopeTest ruby
  # Call a method on the host bot (scope)
  result = private_function

  # Read an instance variable
  hello = @hello

  # Modify an instance variable
  @counter += 1

  return "Function result: #{result}\n" \
         "this.hello: #{hello}\n" \
         "this.counter: #{@counter}"
< object
